{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game About Breaking A Cube is a dystopian horror sim I thought I'd make because breaking stuff is just soooo satisfying. Take a role of the E.R.A.S.E.R. and take a ride underground to the mysterious underbelly of NullCorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Cubes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of different cubes to break, made of stone, metal, meat? and even fabric of cosmos. It all makes sense for sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/c7ff68944b75c1fa98bcc2ca71051da0.poster.avif?t=1765933492\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/c7ff68944b75c1fa98bcc2ca71051da0.webm?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/c7ff68944b75c1fa98bcc2ca71051da0.mp4?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/aa4fcdf061d488ff514ae383c6a27397.webp?t=1765933492\" width=1200 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Strange Treasures Found Inside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract valuables from the cubes. Why are they getting so weird though? First ores, then teeth now this...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/75bb4253b463a9aec0ee4480b6970597.poster.avif?t=1765933492\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/75bb4253b463a9aec0ee4480b6970597.webm?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/75bb4253b463a9aec0ee4480b6970597.mp4?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/aa4fcdf061d488ff514ae383c6a27397.webp?t=1765933492\" width=1200 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incinerate Contaminated Ores</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is enough. Some of the materials aren't suppose to see the light of day. Don't make a mistake though... Corporation doesn't forgive inefficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/ad6c5b118c30a1bb0ba01f6c0ae32ec4.poster.avif?t=1765933492\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/ad6c5b118c30a1bb0ba01f6c0ae32ec4.webm?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/ad6c5b118c30a1bb0ba01f6c0ae32ec4.mp4?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/aa4fcdf061d488ff514ae383c6a27397.webp?t=1765933492\" width=1200 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn't hurt to take a break and walk around a little bit, stretch your legs. There is definitely nothing suspicious to find around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/584b4832caca04ccaa388a2e56a248d9.poster.avif?t=1765933492\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/584b4832caca04ccaa388a2e56a248d9.webm?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/584b4832caca04ccaa388a2e56a248d9.mp4?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/aa4fcdf061d488ff514ae383c6a27397.webp?t=1765933492\" width=1200 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn Secrets of Nullcorp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is this corpo up to anyway? No other way to find out but go deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/fe1476c1841b36bed33d2942e4ec724b.poster.avif?t=1765933492\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/fe1476c1841b36bed33d2942e4ec724b.webm?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/extras/fe1476c1841b36bed33d2942e4ec724b.mp4?t=1765933492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902160?t=1765933492","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902160/e7ecb254707b88705b314141dec2dd971d6ffb97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765933492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st